hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16177","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, he said: Mamar informed us, from Uthman ibn Zufar, from some of Banu Rafi ibn Makith, from Rafi ibn Makith, and he was of those who witnessed al-Hudaybiyah, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Good character is growth, and bad character is evil omen, and righteousness is increase in life, and charity prevents an evil death."
